      "decision": "M1",
      "why": "The regulator body overhangs the M2 mounting hole H4 after the L1 repair moved it clear of the hole's copper. H4 is a bare drilled hole, not a part: nothing is placed there, so nothing collides at assembly. What it constrains is the enclosure -- the screw head and washer have to clear the SOT-223 body -- which is a mechanical decision taken outside this pipeline.",
